            # ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
            # === RESEARCH-BACKED SCORE BONUSES (BACKTEST_CHANGE_126-144) ===
            # BACKTEST_CHANGE_128: EMA Pullback + StochRSI — pullback in uptrend confirmed by oversold
